  "body": "It is a mistake in value of `img` property isn't it? I suppose value must be  `hedral.jpeg` otherwise it contradicts  [5.2.4 Values](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/microdata.html#values)\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/microdata.html#selecting-names-when-defining-vocabularies\r\n\r\n> img |\t\\.\\.\\./hedral\\.jpeg\r\n\r\nRoot of the uncertainty is that an example I'm talking about here is presented by  snipped and we don't know an address of the page it originated from, but I think that it is more natural to think that the page and the image are siblings.",
